    <noscript>
      <div class="noscript-note">
        <h1>Auto Rush — Gurugram Grand Prix</h1>
        <p>
          Auto Rush is a free browser racing game. You drive an Indian auto-rickshaw against seven
          CPU rivals on tracks that follow real roads in two cities. In Gurugram: down through the
          glass office towers of Cyber City, along MG Road under the Yellow Line metro, over the
          IFFCO Chowk flyover onto NH-48, and through the lanes of Mahipalpur village. In Delhi:
          from the Jantar Mantar dharna down to Parliament and back up Sansad Marg, round the
          Connaught Place circles past Palika Bazar to New Delhi station, down Kartavya Path to
          India Gate, and round the walls of the Red Fort.
        </p>
        <p>
          Steer with the arrow keys, hold Shift to drift, collect N₂O canisters from the road for a nitro boost, and pick
          from eight auto liveries, three difficulty levels, one to five laps, and morning, sunset or night.
          Nothing to install — <strong>please enable JavaScript to play</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </noscript>

